    "detailed_description": "<h1>YOU MIGHT ALSO LIKE</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><strong>Make your own unique character\u2019s build:</strong><br><br>Do you want to be a warrior with a two-handed sword and cast fireballs? You are welcome! <br>Learn magic spell from the School of The Lightning and use a bow - not a single bandit will withstand an arrow with an electric charge<br><br><strong>Develop magic skills as you want:</strong><br><br>Attack enemies from a distance or enchant your weapon to cause additional magic damage<br><br><strong>Find an especial way to defeat enemies:</strong><br><br>Each enemy has their own weakness and vulnerability, exploit it<br><br><strong>Different locations and biomes: from swamps to palace rooms:</strong><br><br>Each level has unique room disposition so a player won't be able to remember where to find loot and enemies. This feature increases replayability by times<br><br><strong>Loot an equipment from enemies and chests:</strong><br><br>Use an equipment of defeated enemies while going through the dungeon<br><br><strong>Riddles and puzzles:</strong><br><br>Every level has a puzzle that leads to secret chambers and corridors which brings game experience to a new level",
